dmd39855@uxa.cso.uiuc.edu (TechnoDan) writes:

>I'd like to know everything there is to know about bones levels.

>1)  What are the odds of one being created upon death?

If you die on dungeonlevels 1-3, no bones will be created.
If you die deeper, there is 1/3 chance.

>2)  Are their any modifiers to this chance?

Don't know, maybe on the special levels?

>3)  What are the odds of re-entering a bones level if a file exists on
>    the system for that level?

1/3

>4)  Are there any modifiers to this chance?

Not as far as I know.

>5)  Can discovery mode charcters encounter bones' levels?

Yes. And when you play in wizard mode, every time the game finds a ghost
level, it asks if you want to get the bones.


Disclaimer: I know these probabilities were valid for versions 3.0.*, but
